298-WHAT ARE THE CAUSES OF NON-UNIFORM HEATING? 
299-In order to fully comprehend the capability to heat within 
300-the defined process band, one needs to better understand 
301-the causes of heating non-uniformities. The three main 
302-causes of non-uniform heating in the SMT reflow pro- 
303:cess include mass differential on the product, conveyor 
304-and heater edge effects, and product loading. 
305-MASS DIFFERENTIAL 
306-The amount of temperature rise of a product as it travels 
307-through a heating zone depends upon a number of 
308-variables. The temperature rise of an object subjected to 
--
