774:REVIEW CONVEYOR DESIGN 
775-The conveying mechanism is perhaps the most over- 
776-looked aspect of equipment selection. One needs to 
777:define whether a mesh conveyor or an edge type is 
778:required. Typically edge conveyors are used for in-line 
779-processing or if double-sided assembly is required. The 
780:most important issue with edge conveyors is the ability 
781:for the conveyor to remain straight to avoid dropping 
782-product. 
